I've actually got a patch now -- really, a combination of existing
patches -- which does some things to make it more interesting:

- the Heck patch is used to make mazes more interesting.  They tend
  to be more open, with less exploration needed and more varied terrain
  than the current Gehennom mazes.
- the new demons from the Hell patch are added, along with their
  lairs.
- A random selection of four demon lairs is chosen for Gehennom in
  each game.

I like the effect, but I've only played through it once, so I don't
really have enough experience to make a good judgement as to what 
polishing is needed, which is why I haven't made it available for
download.  In any case, you might look at those for ideas.

